{"parentUuid":"129e9a67-64e6-4807-9098-637b1828893f","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"7e17bded-e9e7-4254-a5e4-f1b6805197e7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"react complierってなんだ？Next.jsだと勝手に入っているのか？"},"uuid":"bab2ff59-6b30-401b-a170-a32c93e3ef91","timestamp":"2026-03-16T14:58:33.273Z","permissionMode":"default","userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/masanao/Obsidian/nexus","sessionId":"2ad3700f-4d1a-4f7a-95fe-722e6c0e0126","version":"2.1.76","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"bab2ff59-6b30-401b-a170-a32c93e3ef91","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Kq1egrwWKPs6PLdPQyLBTm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":311,"cache_read_input_tokens":16445,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":311},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CZ6xS6T6Kjn1nLkyUaKja","type":"assistant","uuid":"403e32e2-75e0-47aa-84fb-8b53df2bd416","timestamp":"2026-03-16T14:58:35.350Z","userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/masanao/Obsidian/nexus","sessionId":"2ad3700f-4d1a-4f7a-95fe-722e6c0e0126","version":"2.1.76","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"403e32e2-75e0-47aa-84fb-8b53df2bd416","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01Kq1egrwWKPs6PLdPQyLBTm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**React Compiler とは:**\n\nJSX/コンポーネントを静的解析して、再レンダリング時に不要な計算やコンポーネント再生成をスキップするコードを**ビルド時に自動挿入**するコンパイラプラグインです。開発者が `useMemo` や `memo` を書かなくても同等の最適化が得られます。\n\n**Next.js では自動では入っていません。** opt-in で有効化が必要です:\n\n```js\n// next.config.js\nconst nextConfig = {\n  experimental: {\n    reactCompiler: true,\n  },\n};\n```\n\n加えて `babel-plugin-react-compiler` のインストールが必要です:\n\n```bash\nnpm install babel-plugin-react-compiler\n```\n\nNext.js 15 以降で対応しています。有効にしない限り従来どおり手動メモ化が必要です。"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":311,"cache_read_input_tokens":16445,"output_tokens":285,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":311,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CZ6xS6T6Kjn1nLkyUaKja","type":"assistant","uuid":"9cf3baa0-202f-4e71-9a4b-b552daf7b29a","timestamp":"2026-03-16T14:58:40.178Z","userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/masanao/Obsidian/nexus","sessionId":"2ad3700f-4d1a-4f7a-95fe-722e6c0e0126","version":"2.1.76","gitBranch":"main"}
{"type":"file-history-snapshot","messageId":"a830e63c-ad39-44ce-9cfe-19a7e1ccfcb2","snapshot":{"messageId":"a830e63c-ad39-44ce-9cfe-19a7e1ccfcb2","trackedFileBackups":{},"timestamp":"2026-03-16T14:59:45.668Z"},"isSnapshotUpdate":false}
{"parentUuid":"9cf3baa0-202f-4e71-9a4b-b552daf7b29a","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"4fa8d46c-c1a3-4b70-9fab-667015f40182","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"この時、component側で、shallow compareか？とかを意識しなくても、、memo化されているってことですか？"},"uuid":"a830e63c-ad39-44ce-9cfe-19a7e1ccfcb2","timestamp":"2026-03-16T14:59:45.668Z","permissionMode":"default","userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/masanao/Obsidian/nexus","sessionId":"2ad3700f-4d1a-4f7a-95fe-722e6c0e0126","version":"2.1.76","gitBranch":"main"}
{"parentUuid":"a830e63c-ad39-44ce-9cfe-19a7e1ccfcb2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_019Us2fCBJyhQi41w9n7hKsV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"はい、そうです。React Compiler は**コンポーネントの props の shallow compare に頼らず**、もっと細かいレベルで最適化します。\n\n**従来の `React.memo`:**\n- props を shallow compare して、変わっていなければ再レンダリングをスキップ\n- オブジェクトや配列を props に渡すと参照が変わるので効かない → `useMemo` / `useCallback` で包む必要あり\n\n**React Compiler:**\n- コンポーネント内部のコードを静的解析して、**どの変数がどの値に依存しているか**を把握\n- 依存が変わっていない部分の計算や JSX 生成を自動でスキップ\n- props 単位ではなく、**式・変数単位**でメモ化を挿入する\n\nつまり:\n\n```jsx\n// React Compiler があれば、これだけで最適に動く\nfunction UserList({ users, onSelect }) {\n  const sorted = users.toSorted((a, b) => a.name.localeCompare(b.name));\n  return sorted.map(u => (\n    <UserItem key={u.id} user={u} onClick={() => onSelect(u.id)} />\n  ));\n}\n```\n\n従来なら `sorted` を `useMemo` で包み、`onClick` を `useCallback` にし、`UserItem` を `React.memo` でラップする必要がありましたが、Compiler がこれらを全部自動でやってくれます。\n\nshallow compare を意識したり、「この props は参照が変わるから...」と考える必要がなくなるのが最大のメリットです。"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":319,"cache_read_input_tokens":16756,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":319},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CZ6xXRzikv3ybk5ebvv2h","type":"assistant","uuid":"f8e0bb17-43cc-48de-882d-b510395390b1","timestamp":"2026-03-16T15:00:01.566Z","userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/masanao/Obsidian/nexus","sessionId":"2ad3700f-4d1a-4f7a-95fe-722e6c0e0126","version":"2.1.76","gitBranch":"main"}
